      "Normal routine blood tests"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "Usually normal brain and spinal imaging",
      "Chest X-ray may show atelectasis or aspiration pneumonia secondary to bulbar weakness"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "No known genetic mutations associated"
